# 16 — Pet Care Manager

## Overview

Develop an application that helps pet owners manage important information and schedules related to their pets.

## Core Features

* Pet profiles
* Vaccination records
* Appointments
* Medication schedules
* Feeding schedules
* Health records
* Reminders

## Possible Extensions

* Health trend visualization
* Personalized reminders
* Appointment recommendations
* Veterinary information management
* AI-based health information assistant

## Suggested Difficulty

Beginner / Intermediate
